@startuml Execution Pipeline Architecture

!theme aws-orange
title Полный пайплайн исполнения: от User Intent до Action Execution
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "👤 User" as User

' === INPUT LAYER ===
package "📥 INPUT CAPTURE & PROCESSING" #E8F4FD {

  rectangle "🎤 Intent Capture" #LightBlue {
    rectangle "Natural Language\n• Speech-to-text\n• Text normalization\n• Intent parsing" as NLInput
    rectangle "Visual Context\n• Screen capture\n• Element detection\n• Layout analysis" as VisualInput
  }

  rectangle "📸 Multi-Platform Screenshot Engine" #LightGreen {
    rectangle "Web Screenshots\n**Tech**: Playwright/Selenium\n• Full page capture\n• Element highlighting\n• DOM structure export" as WebScreenshot
    rectangle "Desktop Screenshots\n**Tech**: PyAutoGUI/Windows API\n• Multi-monitor support\n• Active window detection\n• Element accessibility tree" as DesktopScreenshot
    rectangle "Mobile Screenshots\n**Tech**: Appium/ADB\n• Device screen capture\n• Touch coordinate mapping\n• App state detection" as MobileScreenshot
  }

  rectangle "📊 Clickstream Collector" #LightYellow {
    rectangle "Web Events\n**Tech**: Browser extensions\n• Mouse/keyboard events\n• Page navigation tracking\n• Form interaction logs" as WebEvents
    rectangle "Desktop Events\n**Tech**: Windows hooks/macOS CGEvent\n• Global input monitoring\n• Application focus tracking\n• Window state changes" as DesktopEvents
    rectangle "Mobile Events\n**Tech**: UIAutomator/XCUITest\n• Touch gesture recording\n• App lifecycle events\n• Screen orientation changes" as MobileEvents
  }
}

' === CORE PROCESSING ===
package "🧠 CORE BPG + LLM PROCESSING" #F0F8FF {

  rectangle "Knowledge Base Layer" #E8F5E8 {
    rectangle "🏗️ BPG Knowledge Store\n**Tech**: Neo4j + PostgreSQL\n• Entity relationships\n• Process patterns\n• Business constraints\n• UI element mappings" as BPGStore
    rectangle "📚 Vector Knowledge\n**Tech**: Pinecone/Milvus\n• Semantic entity search\n• Pattern similarity\n• Context matching" as VectorStore
  }

  rectangle "🤖 LLM Orchestration Layer" #FFF8E1 {
    rectangle "🎯 Intent Analysis\n**Tech**: GPT-4 + fine-tuned model\n• User goal extraction\n• Context understanding\n• Ambiguity resolution" as IntentAnalysis
    rectangle "🔍 Context Enrichment\n**Tech**: Custom Python service\n• BPG context assembly\n• Prompt optimization\n• Token budget management" as ContextEnrichment
    rectangle "👁️ Visual Understanding\n**Tech**: GPT-4V + CLIP\n• Screenshot analysis\n• Element identification\n• Spatial relationships" as VisualUnderstanding
    rectangle "📋 Action Planning\n**Tech**: GPT-4 + business rules\n• Step sequence generation\n• Validation checks\n• Error handling plans" as ActionPlanning
  }
}

' === EXECUTION LAYER ===
package "⚡ MULTI-PLATFORM EXECUTION LAYER" #F5F0FF {

  rectangle "🌐 Web Execution Engine" #E6F7FF {
    rectangle "Browser Control\n**Tech**: Playwright/Selenium\n• Element interaction\n• JavaScript execution\n• Page navigation\n• Cookie/session management" as BrowserControl
    rectangle "Smart Selectors\n**Tech**: Custom algorithms\n• Dynamic CSS selectors\n• XPath fallbacks\n• Visual element matching\n• Text-based identification" as WebSelectors
  }

  rectangle "🖥️ Desktop Execution Engine" #F0FFF0 {
    rectangle "Windows Automation\n**Tech**: pyautogui + Windows API\n• Window management\n• Keyboard/mouse simulation\n• Accessibility API integration\n• OCR text recognition" as WindowsAutomation
    rectangle "macOS Automation\n**Tech**: PyObjC + AppleScript\n• Cocoa API integration\n• Accessibility inspector\n• System events handling" as MacAutomation
    rectangle "Linux Automation\n**Tech**: python-xlib + AT-SPI\n• X11 window management\n• Accessibility toolkit\n• Desktop environment APIs" as LinuxAutomation
  }

  rectangle "📱 Mobile Execution Engine" #FFF0F5 {
    rectangle "Android Automation\n**Tech**: Appium + UIAutomator2\n• Touch gestures\n• App activities\n• System UI interaction\n• Device capabilities" as AndroidAutomation
    rectangle "iOS Automation\n**Tech**: Appium + XCUITest\n• UI element hierarchy\n• Touch and gesture actions\n• App lifecycle management\n• Device permissions" as iOSAutomation
  }

  rectangle "🔧 Execution Coordinator" #FFFACD {
    rectangle "Platform Adapter\n**Tech**: Factory pattern\n• Platform detection\n• Adapter selection\n• Command translation\n• Error standardization" as PlatformAdapter
    rectangle "Action Executor\n**Tech**: Async task queue\n• Command queuing\n• Parallel execution\n• Retry mechanisms\n• State verification" as ActionExecutor
    rectangle "Real-time Monitoring\n**Tech**: Event-driven architecture\n• Execution tracking\n• Performance metrics\n• Error detection\n• Recovery triggers" as RealtimeMonitor
  }
}

' === FEEDBACK LAYER ===
package "🔄 FEEDBACK & ADAPTATION" #E6F3FF {
  rectangle "📊 Execution Analytics\n**Tech**: InfluxDB + Grafana\n• Performance monitoring\n• Success rate tracking\n• Error pattern analysis\n• User behavior insights" as ExecutionAnalytics
  rectangle "🎓 Learning Engine\n**Tech**: MLflow + custom algorithms\n• Pattern optimization\n• Selector refinement\n• Context improvement\n• Prompt evolution" as LearningEngine
  rectangle "🔄 Knowledge Updates\n**Tech**: Event sourcing\n• BPG enrichment\n• Pattern discovery\n• Rule refinement\n• Template evolution" as KnowledgeUpdates
}

' === DATA FLOWS ===

' Input Flow
User --> NLInput : "Add item to cart"
User --> VisualInput : Current screen

NLInput --> IntentAnalysis : Natural language
VisualInput --> WebScreenshot : Web page
VisualInput --> DesktopScreenshot : Desktop app
VisualInput --> MobileScreenshot : Mobile app

WebScreenshot --> VisualUnderstanding : Base64 image + DOM
DesktopScreenshot --> VisualUnderstanding : Screenshot + accessibility tree
MobileScreenshot --> VisualUnderstanding : Screenshot + UI hierarchy

' Context Processing
IntentAnalysis --> ContextEnrichment : Parsed intent
BPGStore --> ContextEnrichment : Business context
VectorStore --> ContextEnrichment : Similar patterns
ContextEnrichment --> ActionPlanning : Enriched prompt

VisualUnderstanding --> ActionPlanning : Visual analysis
ActionPlanning --> PlatformAdapter : Action sequence

' Execution Flow
PlatformAdapter --> BrowserControl : Web commands
PlatformAdapter --> WindowsAutomation : Desktop commands (Windows)
PlatformAdapter --> MacAutomation : Desktop commands (macOS)
PlatformAdapter --> LinuxAutomation : Desktop commands (Linux)
PlatformAdapter --> AndroidAutomation : Mobile commands (Android)
PlatformAdapter --> iOSAutomation : Mobile commands (iOS)

BrowserControl --> ActionExecutor : Browser actions
WindowsAutomation --> ActionExecutor : Windows actions
MacAutomation --> ActionExecutor : macOS actions
LinuxAutomation --> ActionExecutor : Linux actions
AndroidAutomation --> ActionExecutor : Android actions
iOSAutomation --> ActionExecutor : iOS actions

ActionExecutor --> RealtimeMonitor : Execution results

' Feedback Loop
RealtimeMonitor --> ExecutionAnalytics : Performance data
ExecutionAnalytics --> LearningEngine : Analytics insights
LearningEngine --> KnowledgeUpdates : Optimization suggestions
KnowledgeUpdates --> BPGStore : Updated patterns

' Clickstream Integration
WebEvents --> BPGStore : Web interaction patterns
DesktopEvents --> BPGStore : Desktop usage patterns
MobileEvents --> BPGStore : Mobile interaction patterns

' === TECHNOLOGY STACK DETAILS ===

note right of WebScreenshot
**Web Screenshot Tech:**
• Playwright headless browsers
• Full page + element screenshots
• DOM tree extraction
• Network request logging
• Performance metrics capture

**Data Format:**
```json
{
  "screenshot": "base64_image_data",
  "dom": "html_structure",
  "url": "current_page_url",
  "viewport": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080},
  "timestamp": "2024-01-20T10:30:00Z"
}
```
end note

note right of DesktopScreenshot
**Desktop Screenshot Tech:**
• Windows: Win32 API + UI Automation
• macOS: CGImage + Accessibility API
• Linux: X11 + AT-SPI

**Data Format:**
```json
{
  "screenshot": "base64_image_data",
  "accessibility_tree": "ui_elements",
  "active_window": "window_info",
  "cursor_position": {"x": 100, "y": 200},
  "timestamp": "2024-01-20T10:30:00Z"
}
```
end note

note right of BrowserControl
**Web Command Execution:**
```python
# Playwright example
async def execute_click(selector, page):
    element = await page.wait_for_selector(selector)
    await element.click()

    # Verify action success
    await page.wait_for_load_state('networkidle')
    return await capture_result_screenshot()
```

**Command Types:**
• click(selector)
• type(selector, text)
• navigate(url)
• scroll(direction, amount)
• wait(condition, timeout)
end note

note right of WindowsAutomation
**Desktop Command Execution:**
```python
# Windows automation example
import pyautogui
import win32gui

def execute_desktop_click(x, y):
    # Move to coordinates
    pyautogui.moveTo(x, y)

    # Click element
    pyautogui.click()

    # Verify action (screenshot comparison)
    return capture_verification_screenshot()
```

**Coordinate Translation:**
• GPT-4V provides relative coordinates
• Convert to absolute screen coordinates
• Handle multi-monitor setups
end note

note bottom
**Key Data Flow Summary:**

1. **Input Capture**: Multi-platform screenshot + clickstream collection
2. **Context Assembly**: BPG knowledge + user intent + visual analysis
3. **LLM Processing**: GPT-4V analyzes screenshots + GPT-4 plans actions
4. **Command Translation**: Platform-specific action commands generation
5. **Execution**: Automated interaction with target applications
6. **Verification**: Post-action screenshot comparison + success validation
7. **Learning**: Performance data feeds back into BPG knowledge updates

**Critical Integration Points:**
• Screenshot → GPT-4V (base64 encoding, size optimization)
• BPG Context → LLM Prompt (token budget optimization)
• LLM Output → Platform Commands (structured JSON parsing)
• Execution Results → BPG Updates (pattern refinement)
end note

@enduml